{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a76e6d0114d60b0261c5c1787045c74ee40bacdf7eb63aca16b2ec63302416e4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0453c155ee11c86f9804c924e3e8976deb3914546527a2a7e783d46d21c1eee",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●●●●●●●P酱？\n你现在有一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50bf4091d3fb43e05cebf1697acc31b06f7f53923d50cbdc0b86b7aeec8365ec",
      "text": "嗯，有的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:429548447d580dc0f08552f195ba4d44620eb523221845b519cfd517a2da2e6d",
      "text": "太好了。其实是关于前几天活动的事……\n我想再跟你说声谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f960d8211c3ada687e8a566f6cc8452b7b901aec8d07b03ac467d2b7f9c7fa07",
      "text": "那份工作之所以能成功，多亏了天峰君和眉见君\n陪着我进行了那么多的练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26dc1fc889be994a0bc8b516008d139839a4ab4e5458d610367024712e72fa73",
      "text": "而且也是因为有●●●●●●●●●●P酱\n每一天都在全力支持着我们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15452f503d75e4640e2402f13d68a1dae9e80a8d090f263faa48969c9c3f934b",
      "text": "在我们训练的时候，\n你总是会跟我们说各种鼓励的话吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:862f1acb6ab0dd3aa627816fb099d825c8ca2dcddf0b79e8e5a30a7a6c1fbd24",
      "text": "……那些话，真的让我特别高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d5f7556173ff1e1488be3ca36acc8e89d52aa4f75d961e2ad55b362a65cbde4",
      "text": "啊，不仅是言语哦。\n为你花在我身上的时间，我全都感到无比幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23dab12b4b8511ab121530750d9ea93edb2935011f192bc01d75af737d45f73d",
      "text": "我只是做了\n力所能及的事而已！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a71da7b6297e456e905c27fd4fbfffa7680e03938f9cc8c347250d92625a4b8",
      "text": "今后我也会继续\n传达这份支持与鼓励的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37dcda0357b49d1ebf2c2a6b7e656da59a1e8bc3b3ac61be00066b729bb267da",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n啊啊，有你在身边真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_a:2_4_048_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67fc01b6ff7c874624e2b4fbb46ab4c096dd0563bc642e3d4b7711731003707b",
      "text": "接下来的工作，我也会超级努力的哦。\n那就明天见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
